Output raw/01-bccard-eatpl.mp4
Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontFamily "FiraCode Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1920
Set Height 1080
Set Padding 16
Set Framerate 30
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 70ms
Hide
Type "cd /tmp/demo && clear && omp --model openrouter/z-ai/glm-5.3-flash --no-session"
Enter
Wait+Screen@90s /Connected to MCP/
Sleep 1s
Show
Sleep 1s
Type "강남역 근처 맛집 3곳만 추천해줘. 한 줄씩 짧게."
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 70s
